From acb13e58f7d8f6eb5ef3f987c4ec34b7a70c8812 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:51:48 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: saving through the Pause menu

The Pause menu was shut in the arena in two places (field_sequence/run.c and
window/settings_menu.c); both now let it open, with Save your quest, behind
ARENA_PAUSE_MENU. window/screens/arena_save.c (a part of screens.c) writes a
file saved in the arena as if the game stood at the arena's door with no series
running, so a load does not replay the last battle's reward or resume a series,
and puts the live values back after. Continue loads it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
